      "alt": "TQMLS1043A board",
      "text": "<h1>Based on the ARM® Quad Cortex®-A53 and NXP LS1043A processor</h1>\n<p>The TQMLS1043A is an embedded Quad Cortex-A53 module based on the LS1043A processor from NXP. It offers robust capabilities for various applications such as networking and industrial automation, providing high-speed communication with 10 Gbit Ethernet, 8x Gbit Ethernet, PCIe, and USB 3.0 interfaces. With DDR4 and optional ECC protection, it ensures reliable and secure memory operation. This module features an extended temperature range, making it suitable for harsh environments. It also includes advanced security functions, leveraging the QorIQ Trust Architecture and Arm TrustZone.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 11:01:39 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
